ent-ShuttleGunSeismic = EXP-SMC "CosmoQuake"
    .desc = Salvage stationary mining turret. Requires seismic charges, extremely effective for asteroid excavation.
ent-ShuttleGunPlasmaCutter = PLM-CTT "Shuttle Cutter"
    .desc = Basic stationary plasma cutter unit. Effective against asteroids. Uses regular power cells to fire, and has slow rate of fire.
ent-ShuttleGunMineralVacuum = MNV-EX "Mineral Vacuum"
    .desc = A mining tool designed to vacuum up loose minerals in space. Not a weapon.
